  "description": "Watch now | NVIDIA acquisition, a silver setup worth watching, and why this market may be quietly preparing for its next breakout.",
  "body_html": "<p>Watch the video. I make them because its easier and faster for you. </p><h4>This video focuses on:</h4><ol><li><p><strong>Nvidia acquiring Nebius</strong> - It is <em><strong>normally</strong></em> bearish for acquiring companies. </p><ol><li><p>I would be tickled to death to watch NVDA plummet lol. Regardless my personal analysis and opinion on NVDA, it is <strong>not </strong>in short territory. The company being acquired, Nebius here, benefits and usually moves to higher prices. </p></li></ol></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-298501369?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Stock Pick of the Week</a> </strong>was posted yesterday. See the video as to why I selected <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$HXL&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>. </p></li><li><p><strong>Silver</strong> appears to have bottomed. We do not call bottoms, and are still awaiting a clear breakout. But we are seeing bears lose strength in controlling price direction. </p></li><li><p> <strong>Broader market</strong> continues to consolidate, in an annoying…but good…way. It continues to coil for what I think will be the final blow off top leg. </p><p></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p></li></ol><p>If you have questions, feel free to tag me in the <em><strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/9f426ce5-4ad0-414b-8948-b111b7ad31b2\">Main Chat</a> </strong></em>during market hours. </p><p>We will be doing Mid-Week Movers tomorrow. If you are new, this where I take your favorite stocks and rank them from worst to first. So be on the lookout for that. </p><h4>Please like ❤️ and re-stack this post, its how we fight Substack AI Slop. </h4><p>Thanks for stopping by! </p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-calm-before-the-next-big-move?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Like this run down? Share it with a friend!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-calm-before-the-next-big-move?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-calm-before-the-next-big-move?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div>",
